msgid "plugins.generic.depositHub.description"
msgstr "One board for where each published paper stands outside the site: DOI and its OJS deposit status, actual presence in Crossref with abstract, references and ORCID, DOI resolving to the right landing page, OpenAlex presence and citations, and a Google Scholar search link. Journal level: Crossref coverage (abstracts, references, ORCID, affiliations, ROR, licences) and presence in OpenAlex and DOAJ. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah."

